  "content": "<p>FTB Quests 是一个轻量级、基于团队的任务模组，使用起来非常简单。更多详情请查阅<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.feed-the-beast.com%252fdocs%252fmods%252fsuite%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基百科</a>！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h4><strong>警告</strong></h4><p>从 FTB Quests 1902.5.0 版本开始，若需在 FTB Quests 中集成 KubeJS、JEI、REI 或游戏阶段，您必须使用 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-xmod-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB XMod Compat</a>。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>重要提示：</strong>FTB Quests 2001.3.0 及以上版本需要 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-xmod-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB XMod Compat 2.1.0+</a> 才能与 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/item-filters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Item Filters 模组</a>集成。Item Filters 不再是硬依赖项。此外，现在支持新的 FTB Filter System 模组作为 Item Filters 的推荐替代方案（同样需要 FTB XMod Compat 2.1.0+）。</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/AOKB8t.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/fsj_Ce.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>支持</h2><ul>\n<li>对于<strong>整合包</strong>问题，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>对于<strong>模组</strong>问题，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>还有疑问？欢迎加入我们的 Discord 社区：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>保持关注</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
